# Repo-root .ignore — installed by `agentkit sync` as `.ignore` (NOT `.gitignore`).
# Honored by ripgrep-based search, including Claude Code's Grep tool. Keeps finished/inert
# material OUT of the default agent search path while it stays TRACKED in git.
# Canonical spec: governance/docs-standard.md §(e),(f).
#
# Search the excluded paths on demand with:  rg --no-ignore <pattern> docs/archive
# codebase-mcp: add these same globs to the indexer's exclusion config so the graph skips them.

# Completed work — history, not context.
docs/archive/

# Quarantined evidence (research corpora) — source material, never contracts.
docs/raw-research/
docs/research/
